---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Outdoor Video Production, 4K Drone Filming & TV Broadcast in Quebec | Endurance Aventure"
  description="4K cinematography in remote wilderness, Transport Canada certified drone pilots, and documentary TV production for endurance sports in Quebec."
  image="/assets/production-tele-services-endurance-aventure-e1517973509712.jpg"
  lang="en"
>
  <!-- Immersive Dark Header with Production Crew Photo -->
  <header class="relative min-h-[48vh] sm:min-h-[55vh] flex items-center bg-slate-950 border-b border-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
    <img 
      src="/assets/51587110257_0a9957d7f5_k.webp" 
      alt="Audiovisual production and extreme filming in wilderness environments" 
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-90 brightness-95 contrast-105"
      onerror="this.src='/assets/production-tele-services-endurance-aventure-e1517973509712.jpg'"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-950/75 via-black/20 to-black/20"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/50 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>

    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 py-16 sm:py-20 w-full">
      <a href="/en/services/organisation-evenements/" class="text-xs text-brand-cyan hover:text-white font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 transition-colors">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/></svg>
        <span>Pro Services</span>
      </a>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-black uppercase text-white mb-4 drop-shadow-lg">
        TV & Video Production
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-100 font-normal leading-relaxed drop-shadow-md max-w-3xl">
        Breathtaking cinematography captured right at the heart of the action by athletic camera operators trained for extreme terrain.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <div class="bg-slate-50 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-12 shadow-sm border border-slate-200 h-96 bg-slate-200">
        <img src="/assets/JMMsony-September-13-2014_DSC1007.webp" alt="Camera operators and photographers in action in the field" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
        <div>
          <span class="text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Extreme Filmmaking</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Filming in Remote Wilderness & Broadcast TV Shows</h2>
          <p>
            Directed by <strong class="text-slate-900 font-semibold">Daniel Poirier</strong>, our production crew produces adventure documentaries and sports series for major networks (RDS, specialty channels, and international broadcast distributors).
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            Our cinematographers are far more than camera technicians: they are seasoned outdoor athletes capable of operating autonomously in the most demanding wilderness conditions. Mountains, rivers, rapids, canoeing, climbing, rope rigging, and extreme winter temperatures: our teams thrive in hard-to-reach terrain to capture spectacular 4K footage right alongside athletes where traditional film crews cannot go.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 sm:gap-6 my-6 sm:my-8">
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 sm:p-6 rounded-md border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-base mb-1 sm:mb-2">4K Drone Filming</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light line-clamp-4 sm:line-clamp-none">Transport Canada certified pilots. Aerial tracking over packs, canyons, and vast landscapes in 4K.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-slate-50 p-3 sm:p-6 rounded-md border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-xs sm:text-base mb-1 sm:mb-2">Embedded Operators</h3>
            <p class="text-[11px] sm:text-sm text-slate-600 font-light line-clamp-4 sm:line-clamp-none">Our camera operators shadow athletes on foot, skis, kayak, or bike to capture raw effort.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Production Gallery (2 columns on mobile) -->
        <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-100">
          <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6 sm:mb-8">
            <span class="text-brand-cyan text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Production Assets</span>
            <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900">
              All-Terrain Filming in Remote Environments
            </h3>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 sm:gap-4">
            <div class="group rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-slate-200 aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-auto sm:h-56 relative shadow-sm">
              <img src="/assets/Canadaman-xtri-copyright-Quebec-Dones-3-de-5.webp" alt="4K drone aerial filming in remote nature" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <span class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Certified 4K Drone</span>
            </div>
            <div class="group rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-slate-200 aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-auto sm:h-56 relative shadow-sm">
              <img src="/assets/JMMsony-September-13-2014_DSC1025.webp" alt="Photographers and camera operators in the action" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <span class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Field Camera Operators</span>
            </div>
            <div class="group rounded-md overflow-hidden bg-slate-200 aspect-[16/10] sm:aspect-auto sm:h-56 relative shadow-sm">
              <img src="/assets/raid-international-gaspesie-2016-mont-saint-joseph-slack-line.webp" alt="Cliff-side rope camera rigging" class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300" onerror="this.src='/assets/51582278409_86672a9a9f_k.webp'" />
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
              <span class="absolute bottom-2.5 left-3 text-white text-xs font-semibold">Cliffside Rigging</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-md border border-slate-300/80 p-8 sm:p-10 text-center mt-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Planning a Film, Documentary, or Event Coverage?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 max-w-xl mx-auto mb-6">Let's discuss your production specifications and field logistics requirements.</p>
          <a href="/en/contact/" class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 min-h-[44px] rounded-md bg-brand-cyan hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white font-heading font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all inline-flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
            Request a Filming Quote
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
